{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Prevent older concurrent runs from replacing `latest`**\n\nRuns using different JS checkouts may execute concurrently, but these symlink updates are uncoordinated. An older run paused here can resume after a newer run and make `runs/latest` point backward. Serialize marker/pruning/latest updates with a runs-directory lock and compare timestamps before replacing the link; add a concurrent-start test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75PPWd","finding_digest":"a07e2fcb7a2f904c949a490f5b72ca0208ffc5e1d439a604306009fd457f865c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ub7c7s32f6iezfe2jehvw4wkai","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/run.py::new-run-dir::latest-monotonicity","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/run.py::new-run-dir::latest-monotonicity","line":1030,"observation_digest":"8749d347d0c54cc19cb73af863addf344f19568f95bd9d9baa5060fa36d8af5c","observation_id":"aro_v1_q5e5gr6qyvgmdhfxhl4ghlo7gr","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/run.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-05T07:14:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lb24m3ntdz3bxfcp3ukviq3l52","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"845781ebe14c4086a8cb97c2318362f26b8cd3dd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1028,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_76hqodp7ietcnzvfi2ozmrzxso","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T07:14:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
